Frontend Prompt: LegalMind AI - Legal Operations Platform
Project Overview
Build LegalMind AI, a comprehensive legal operations platform with AI-powered capabilities for legal research, document drafting, precedent search, and compliance tracking. This is a demo application showcasing agentic AI for legal professionals.

Core Objective: Create a professional, intuitive interface where legal teams can research laws, generate legal documents with AI assistance, find court precedents, and track compliance deadlines - all in one integrated platform.

Application Architecture
Tech Stack
React 18 + Vite
Tailwind CSS
shadcn/ui or similar component library
React Router v6
Lucide React icons
Recharts for charts
React-datepicker for date inputs
TipTap or similar rich text editor
React-hot-toast for notifications
React-big-calendar for calendar views
Zustand for state management
