Summary
Build a comprehensive, professional legal operations platform with four integrated features:

Research Co-Pilot: AI chat interface for legal research with citations
Draft Orchestrator: Multi-step draft creation with AI assistance, review workflow, and discussion system
Precedent Intelligence: Searchable library of court precedents with auto-scraping capabilities
Compliance Tracker: Court order and deadline tracking with calendar views
Focus on professional design, intuitive user experience, and showcasing the power of AI in legal operations. Create a cohesive platform where all features integrate seamlessly, demonstrating how legal professionals can streamline their workflow from research to draft creation to compliance management.
